# The context tree and the baselines are BUILT, not authored: the CI job rebuilds them per run and
# the refresher rebuilds them per merge. Tracking a 5 MB index also means every run shows up as a
# diff, which is how the previous repo ended up with a private file inventory in git.
.par/
.baseline/
runs/
node_modules/
# Credentials live in the environment (Actions secrets) or in a local, untracked file.
graph/.env
graph/.env.*
!graph/.env.example
